vercomplicate it. The answer is 134.\n\n\n\nThe value of \\( j \\) is calculated as follows:\n\nGiven:\n\\[\nh = 205\n\\]\n\\[\nj = h - 71\n\\]\n\nSubstitute \\( h \\) into the equation for \\( j \\):\n\\[\nj = 205 - 71 = 134\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** 134"}
