1. Add the units place: \\( 9 + 7 = 16 \\). Write down 6 and carry over 1.\n2. Add the tens place: \\( 5 + 3 = 8 \\), plus the carried over 1 gives 9.\n3. Add the hundreds place: \\( 9 + 0 = 9 \\).\n\nPutting it all together, we get 996. Verifying with different methods (breaking into smaller parts, number line approach, and alternative addition strategies) all confirm the result.\n\nThus, the value of \\( m \\) is \\(\\boxed{996}\\)."}
