think that's it. No steps skipped, and each arithmetic operation was done step by step. Seems solid.\n\n\n\nTo determine the value of \\( g \\), we follow the sequence of assignments step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nt &= 656 \\\\\ni &= t + 83 = 656 + 83 = 739 \\\\\nx &= i + 11 = 739 + 11 = 750 \\\\\nl &= x + 62 = 750 + 62 = 812 \\\\\nu &= l - 33 = 812 - 33 = 779 \\\\\nq &= u - 30 = 779 - 30 = 749 \\\\\na &= q + 27 = 749 + 27 = 776 \\\\\no &= a - 26 = 776 - 26 = 750 \\\\\nh &= o + 10 = 750 + 10 = 760 \\\\\nb &= h + 36 = 760 + 36 = 796 \\\\\nf &= b + 31 = 796 + 31 = 827 \\\\\nv &= f + 47 = 827 + 47 = 874 \\\\\np &= v - 35 = 874 - 35 = 839 \\\\\nr &= p + 33 = 839 + 33 = 872 \\\\\nd &= r + 59 = 872 + 59 = 931 \\\\\ng &= d - 12 = 931 - 12 = 919 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**The value of \\( g \\) is \\(\\boxed{919}\\).**"}
