z &= r - 67 = 737 - 67 = 670 \\\\\nx &= z + 89 = 670 + 89 = 759 \\\\\nq &= x + 77 = 759 + 77 = 836 \\\\\ns &= q + 17 = 836 + 17 = 853 \\\\\ng &= s + 34 = 853 + 34 = 887 \\\\\nf &= g + 86 = 887 + 86 = 973 \\\\\nv &= f + 69 = 973 + 69 = 1042 \\\\\np &= v - 66 = 1042 - 66 = 976 \\\\\nu &= p + 76 = 976 + 76 = 1052 \\\\\nb &= u + 91 = 1052 + 91 = 1143 \\\\\nh &= b - 73 = 1143 - 73 = 1070 \\\\\ne &= h + 94 = 1070 + 94 = 1164 \\\\\nc &= e + 68 = 1164 + 68 = 1232 \\\\\nw &= c - 62 = 1232 - 62 = 1170 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** The value of \\( w \\) is \\(\\boxed{1170}\\)."}
