ract 30 from 493, which is 463. So q = 463.\n\nAfter that, x is q minus 36. So 463 - 36. Let me compute that. 463 - 30 is 433, then subtract 6 more: 433 - 6 = 427. So x = 427.\n\nNext, l is x plus 83. Since x is 427, adding 83. Let's break that down: 427 + 80 = 507, then +3 = 510. Therefore, l = 510.\n\nThen e is l plus 19. So 510 + 19. That's 529. So e = 529.\n\nMoving on, m is e minus 97. 529 - 97. Hmm, maybe 529 - 100 = 429, then add back 3, so 429 + 3 = 432. So m = 432.\n\nThen a is m minus 21. 432 - 21 is 411. Therefore, a = 411.\n\nNext, u is a plus 17. 411 + 17. Let's calculate: 411 + 10 = 421, then +7 = 428. So u = 428.\n\nThen z is u plus 21. 428 + 21 is 449. So z = 449.\n\nNext, t is z minus 66. 449 - 66. Let's do that step by step: 449 - 60 = 389, then -6 = 383. So t = 383.\n\nThen k is t plus 94. 383 + 94. Let me add 90 first: 383 + 90 = 473, then +4 = 477. So k = 477.\n\nNext, s is k minus 27. 477 - 27. That's 450. So s = 450.\n\nThen h is s minus 89. 450 - 89. Hmm, 450 - 80 = 370, then -9 = 361. So h = 361.\n\nFinally, j is h plus 99. So 361 + 99. Let me compute that: 361 + 100 = 461, minus 1 = 460. So j = 460.\n\nWait, let me double-check each step to make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. Starting from p=333:\n\ni = 333 +94 = 427 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nv = 427 +66 = 493 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nq = 493 -30 = 463 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nx = 463 -36 = 427 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nl = 427 +83 = 510 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ne = 510 +19 = 529 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nm = 529 -97 = 432 \u2714\ufe0f\n\na = 432 -21 = 411 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nu = 411 +17 = 428 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nz = 428 +21 = 449 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nt = 449 -66 = 383 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nk = 383 +94 = 477 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ns = 477 -27 = 450 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nh = 450 -89 = 361 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nj = 361 +99 = 460 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nAll steps check out. Each calculation seems correct. So the final value of j should be 460.\n\n\n\nThe value of \\( j \\) is calculated by sequentially evaluating each variable starting from \\( p = 333 \\):\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\ni &= p + 94 = 333 + 94 = 427, \\\\\nv &= i + 66 = 427 + 66 = 493, \\\\\nq &= v - 30 = 493 - 30 = 463, \\\\\nx &= q - 36 = 463 - 36 = 427, \\\\\nl &= x + 83 = 427 + 83 = 510, \\\\\ne &= l + 19 = 510 + 19 = 529, \\\\\nm &= e - 97 = 529 - 97 = 432, \\\\\na &= m - 21 = 432 - 21 = 411, \\\\\nu &= a + 17 = 411 + 17 = 428, \\\\\nz &= u + 21 = 428 + 21 = 449, \\\\\nt &= z - 66 = 449 - 66 = 383, \\\\\nk &= t + 94 = 383 + 94 = 477, \\\\\ns &= k - 27 = 477 - 27 = 450, \\\\\nh &= s - 89 = 450 - 89 = 361, \\\\\nj &= h + 99 = 361 + 99 = 460.\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** \\(\\boxed{460}\\)"}
