 from 886. Let's do 886 - 30 first, which is 856, and then subtract 1 more, giving 855. So i is 855.\n\nThen y is i + 93. So 855 plus 93. Let's break it down: 855 + 90 = 945, then +3 = 948. Hence, y is 948.\n\nAfter that, j is y + 25. 948 + 25. That's 973. So j equals 973.\n\nNext up is c, which is j - 13. 973 minus 13. 973 - 10 is 963, then -3 is 960. So c is 960.\n\nThen o is c + 45. 960 + 45. Let's add 40 to get 1000, and then add 5 more, resulting in 1005. Therefore, o is 1005.\n\nNow e is o + 58. Adding 58 to 1005. 1005 + 50 is 1055, plus 8 is 1063. So e is 1063.\n\nNext, x is e - 84. So 1063 minus 84. Let's subtract 80 first: 1063 - 80 = 983, then subtract 4 more: 983 - 4 = 979. Therefore, x is 979.\n\nThen k is x - 87. Subtracting 87 from 979. Let's do 979 - 80 = 899, then -7 = 892. So k is 892.\n\nNow g is k + 92. 892 + 92. Breaking it down: 892 + 90 = 982, then +2 = 984. Wait, that doesn't seem right. Wait, 892 + 90 is indeed 982, plus 2 more is 984. Wait, but 892 + 92 is the same as 892 + 90 + 2, which is 984. So g is 984.\n\nFinally, l is g + 84. So 984 + 84. Let's add 80 first: 984 + 80 = 1064, then +4 = 1068. So l should be 1068.\n\nWait, let me double-check each step to make sure I didn't make any mistakes. Starting from the beginning:\n\nd = 896  \nt = 896 + 43 = 939 \u2714\ufe0f  \nw = 939 + 50 = 989 \u2714\ufe0f  \nu = 989 - 43 = 946 \u2714\ufe0f  \nq = 946 - 90 = 856 \u2714\ufe0f  \nh = 856 + 30 = 886 \u2714\ufe0f  \ni = 886 - 31 = 855 \u2714\ufe0f  \ny = 855 + 93 = 948 \u2714\ufe0f  \nj = 948 + 25 = 973 \u2714\ufe0f  \nc = 973 - 13 = 960 \u2714\ufe0f  \no = 960 + 45 = 1005 \u2714\ufe0f  \ne = 1005 + 58 = 1063 \u2714\ufe0f  \nx = 1063 - 84 = 979 \u2714\ufe0f  \nk = 979 - 87 = 892 \u2714\ufe0f  \ng = 892 + 92 = 984 \u2714\ufe0f  \nl = 984 + 84 = 1068 \u2714\ufe0f  \n\nLooks like all the steps check out. Each calculation seems correct. So the final value of l is 1068.\n\n\n\nThe value of \\( l \\) is calculated step-by-step as follows:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nd &= 896 \\\\\nt &= d + 43 = 896 + 43 = 939 \\\\\nw &= t + 50 = 939 + 50 = 989 \\\\\nu &= w - 43 = 989 - 43 = 946 \\\\\nq &= u - 90 = 946 - 90 = 856 \\\\\nh &= q + 30 = 856 + 30 = 886 \\\\\ni &= h - 31 = 886 - 31 = 855 \\\\\ny &= i + 93 = 855 + 93 = 948 \\\\\nj &= y + 25 = 948 + 25 = 973 \\\\\nc &= j - 13 = 973 - 13 = 960 \\\\\no &= c + 45 = 960 + 45 = 1005 \\\\\ne &= o + 58 = 1005 + 58 = 1063 \\\\\nx &= e - 84 = 1063 - 84 = 979 \\\\\nk &= x - 87 = 979 - 87 = 892 \\\\\ng &= k + 92 = 892 + 92 = 984 \\\\\nl &= g + 84 = 984 + 84 = 1068 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\n\\(\\boxed{1068}\\)"}
