054.\n\nNext is p = g - 43. Starting with 1054, subtract 40 to get 1014, then subtract 3 more: 1014 - 3 = 1011. So p = 1011.\n\nThen s = p + 53. Adding 53 to 1011. Let's calculate: 1011 + 50 is 1061, plus 3 is 1064. So s = 1064.\n\nZ is next: z = s - 38. So 1064 - 38. Let's subtract 30 first: 1064 - 30 = 1034, then minus 8 is 1026. Therefore, z = 1026.\n\nThen r = z - 78. Starting with 1026, subtract 70 to get 956, then subtract 8 more: 956 - 8 = 948. So r = 948.\n\nNext is e = r - 85. So 948 - 85. Let's break that into 948 - 80 = 868, then minus 5 is 863. Thus, e = 863.\n\nFollowing that, u = e - 44. So 863 - 44. Subtract 40 first: 823, then minus 4 is 819. So u = 819.\n\nThen w = u - 80. Taking 819 - 80. That's 739. Therefore, w = 739.\n\nNext, y = w + 46. Adding 46 to 739. 739 + 40 = 779, plus 6 is 785. So y = 785.\n\nFinally, m = y - 82. So 785 - 82. Subtract 80 to get 705, then subtract 2 more: 703. So m = 703.\n\nWait, let me double-check each step to make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. Starting from f = 808:\n\nd = 808 + 51 = 859 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nv = 859 + 40 = 899 \u2714\ufe0f\n\no = 899 + 40 = 939 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nk = 939 + 56 = 995 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nh = 995 + 96 = 1091 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ng = 1091 - 37 = 1054 \u2714\ufe0f\n\np = 1054 - 43 = 1011 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ns = 1011 + 53 = 1064 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nz = 1064 - 38 = 1026 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nr = 1026 - 78 = 948 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ne = 948 - 85 = 863 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nu = 863 - 44 = 819 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nw = 819 - 80 = 739 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ny = 739 + 46 = 785 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nm = 785 - 82 = 703 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nAll steps check out. So m should be 703.\n\n\n\nThe value of \\( m \\) is calculated step by step as follows:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nf &= 808 \\\\\nd &= f + 51 = 808 + 51 = 859 \\\\\nv &= d + 40 = 859 + 40 = 899 \\\\\no &= v + 40 = 899 + 40 = 939 \\\\\nk &= o + 56 = 939 + 56 = 995 \\\\\nh &= k + 96 = 995 + 96 = 1091 \\\\\ng &= h - 37 = 1091 - 37 = 1054 \\\\\np &= g - 43 = 1054 - 43 = 1011 \\\\\ns &= p + 53 = 1011 +