f = 479\n\\]\n\nNext, calculate each subsequent variable step by step:\n\n\\[\nn = f - 18 = 479 - 18 = 461\n\\]\n\\[\nw = n + 39 = 461 + 39 = 500\n\\]\n\\[\ny = w + 98 = 500 + 98 = 598\n\\]\n\\[\nu = y + 65 = 598 + 65 = 663\n\\]\n\\[\nj = u - 88 = 663 - 88 = 575\n\\]\n\\[\np = j - 14 = 575 - 14 = 561\n\\]\n\\[\ng = p - 79 = 561 - 79 = 482\n\\]\n\\[\nt = g - 98 = 482 - 98 = 384\n\\]\n\\[\nq = t + 93 = 384 + 93 = 477\n\\]\n\\[\nz = q - 12 = 477 - 12 = 465\n\\]\n\\[\ni = z + 21 = 465 + 21 = 486\n\\]\n\\[\no = i + 12 = 486 + 12 = 498\n\\]\n\\[\nd = o - 30 = 498 - 30 = 468\n\\]\n\\[\na = d - 61 = 468 - 61 = 407\n\\]\n\\[\nl = a - 29 = 407 - 29 = 378\n\\]\n\nThe value of \\( l \\) is \\(\\boxed{378}\\)."}
