2 + 12 = 1174. So hp = 1174.\n\nWe = hp - 81. 1174 - 81. Subtract 80 first: 1094, then -1 = 1093. So we = 1093.\n\nVu = we - 57. 1093 - 57. Let's subtract 50: 1043, then -7 = 1036. So vu = 1036.\n\nKl = vu - 77. 1036 - 77. Hmm, subtract 70 first: 966, then -7 = 959. So kl = 959.\n\nYa = kl - 47. 959 - 47. Subtract 40: 919, then -7 = 912. So ya = 912.\n\nDm = ya + 96. 912 + 96. 912 + 90 = 1002, +6 = 1008. So dm = 1008.\n\nQs = dm - 16. 1008 - 16 = 992. So qs = 992.\n\nNf = qs + 64. 992 + 64. 992 + 60 = 1052, +4 = 1056. So nf = 1056.\n\nDr = nf - 22. 1056 - 22 = 1034. So dr = 1034.\n\nOg = dr - 41. 1034 - 41. Subtract 40: 994, then -1 = 993. So og = 993.\n\nQd = og + 87. 993 + 87. 993 + 80 = 1073, +7 = 1080. So qd = 1080.\n\nJw = qd - 67. 1080 - 67. 1080 - 60 = 1020, then -7 = 1013. So jw = 1013.\n\nRn = jw - 19. 1013 - 19 = 994. So rn = 994.\n\nWait, let me double-check some steps to make sure I didn't make a mistake. Starting from the beginning:\n\nwp = 816\n\nde = 816 +35 = 851 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ntc = 851 -22 = 829 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nkh = 829 +85 = 914 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nbl = 914 +93 = 1007 \u2714\ufe0f\n\naa = 1007 -72 = 935 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nft = 935 +75 = 1010 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nxc = 1010 +91 = 1101 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nsn = 1101 -41 = 1060 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nos = 1060 -48 = 1012 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nmp = 1012 -85 = 927 \u2714\ufe0f\n\naw = 927 +21 = 948 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nkt = 948 +24 = 972 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ntg = 972 -49 = 923 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nhu = 923 +58 = 981 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nqh = 981 -38 = 943 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nvf = 943 +86 = 1029 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nvg = 1029 +99 = 1128 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nds = 1128 +34 = 1162 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nhp = 1162 +12 = 1174 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nwe = 1174 -81 = 1093 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nvu = 1093 -57 = 1036 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nkl = 1036 -77 = 959 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nya = 959 -47 = 912 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ndm = 912 +96 = 1008 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nqs = 1008 -16 = 992 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nnf = 992 +64 = 1056 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ndr = 1056 -22 = 1034 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nog = 1034 -41 = 993 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nqd = 993 +87 = 1080 \u2714\ufe0f\n\njw = 1080 -67 = 1013 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nrn = 1013 -19 = 994 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nAll the steps check out. So the final value of rn is 994.\n\n\n\nThe value of **rn** is calculated step-by-step as follows:\n\n1. Start with the initial value:  \n   **wp = 816**\n\n2. Calculate each subsequent variable by applying the given operations:  \n   - **de = 816 + 35 = 851**  \n   - **tc = 851 - 22 = 829**  \n   - **kh = 829 + 85 = 914**  \n   - **bl = 914 + 93 = 1007**  \n   - **aa = 1007 - 72 = 935**  \n   - **ft = 935 + 75 = 1010**  \n   - **xc = 1010 + 91 = 1101**  \n   - **sn = 1101 - 41 = 1060**  \n   - **os = 1060 - 48 = 1012**  \n   - **mp = 1012 - 85 = 927**  \n   - **aw = 927 + 21 = 948**  \n   - **kt = 948 + 24 = 972**  \n   - **tg = 972 - 49 = 923**  \n   - **hu = 923 + 58 = 981**  \n   - **qh = 981 - 38 = 943**  \n   - **vf = 943 + 86 = 1029**  \n   - **vg = 1029 + 99 = 1128**  \n   - **ds = 1128 + 34 = 1162**  \n   - **hp = 1162 + 12 = 1174**  \n   - **we = 1174 - 81 = 1093**  \n   - **vu = 1093 - 57 = 1036**  \n   - **kl = 1036 - 77 = 959**  \n   - **ya = 959 - 47 = 912**  \n   - **dm = 912 + 96 = 1008**  \n   - **qs = 1008 - 16 = 992**  \n   - **nf = 992 + 64 = 1056**  \n   - **dr = 1056 - 22 = 1034**  \n   - **og = 1034 - 41 = 993**  \n   - **qd = 993 + 87 = 1080**  \n   - **jw = 1080 - 67 = 1013**  \n   - **rn = 1013 - 19 = 994**\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe value of **rn** is **994**.  \n\\boxed{994}"}
