&= yg + 33 = 458 + 33 = 491, \\\\\nbi &= rk + 90 = 491 + 90 = 581, \\\\\nmy &= bi - 52 = 581 - 52 = 529, \\\\\nvh &= my - 86 = 529 - 86 = 443, \\\\\ntp &= vh - 41 = 443 - 41 = 402, \\\\\neo &= tp + 31 = 402 + 31 = 433, \\\\\nzo &= eo + 32 = 433 + 32 = 465.\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThe value of \\( zo \\) is \\(\\boxed{465}\\)."}
