 = au + 73. 729 + 73. 700 + 70 = 770, 29 + 3 = 32, so 770 + 32 = 802. ue = 802.\n\nys = ue + 52. 802 + 52 = 854. ys = 854.\n\nqz = ys + 85. 854 + 85. 800 + 80 = 880, 54 + 5 = 59, so 880 + 59 = 939. qz = 939.\n\nod = qz + 59. 939 + 59. 900 + 50 = 950, 39 + 9 = 48, so 950 + 48 = 998. od = 998.\n\ncg = od + 67. 998 + 67. 900 + 60 = 960, 98 + 7 = 105, so 960 + 105 = 1065. cg = 1065.\n\nic = cg + 17. 1065 + 17 = 1082. ic = 1082.\n\nbk = ic - 60. 1082 - 60 = 1022. bk = 1022.\n\nxf = bk + 30. 1022 + 30 = 1052. xf = 1052.\n\non = xf + 97. 1052 + 97. Let's compute 1052 + 100 = 1152, then subtract 3: 1152 - 3 = 1149. So on = 1149.\n\nLet me just double-check a few steps to make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors.\n\nStarting from lk = 773:\n\nlk = 773\n\ndh = 773 + 89 = 862 (correct)\n\nar = 862 + 56 = 918 (correct)\n\nxi = 918 - 83 = 835 (correct)\n\nmc = 835 - 94 = 741 (correct)\n\nqr = 741 - 83 = 658 (correct)\n\noy = 658 + 70 = 728 (correct)\n\nuw = 728 + 71 = 799 (correct)\n\noc = 799 - 96 = 703 (correct)\n\nfd = 703 + 33 = 736 (correct)\n\nho = 736 + 78 = 814 (correct)\n\nkn = 814 - 96 = 718 (correct)\n\nrn = 718 + 84 = 802 (correct)\n\nao = 802 + 20 = 822 (correct)\n\nis = 822 + 64 = 886 (correct)\n\nyl = 886 + 82 = 968 (correct)\n\nrx = 968 - 83 = 885 (correct)\n\naz = 885 - 85 = 800 (correct)\n\nee = 800 - 23 = 777 (correct)\n\ndj = 777 - 46 = 731 (correct)\n\ntq = 731 - 68 = 663 (correct)\n\nqp = 663 + 43 = 706 (correct)\n\nau = 706 + 23 = 729 (correct)\n\nue = 729 + 73 = 802 (correct)\n\nys = 802 + 52 = 854 (correct)\n\nqz = 854 + 85 = 939 (correct)\n\nod = 939 + 59 = 998 (correct)\n\ncg = 998 + 67 = 1065 (correct)\n\nic = 1065 + 17 = 1082 (correct)\n\nbk = 1082 - 60 = 1022 (correct)\n\nxf = 1022 + 30 = 1052 (correct)\n\non = 1052 + 97 = 1149 (correct)\n\nEverything checks out. So the final value of \"on\" should be 1149.\n\n\n\nThe value of **on** is calculated by following each assignment step-by-step:\n\n1. Start with **lk = 773**.\n2. Proceed through each