 break it down: 908 + 70 = 978, then +8 = 986. So eo = 986.\n\nbc = eo + 20. 986 + 20 = 1006. So bc = 1006.\n\nuj = bc + 43. 1006 + 43. 1006 + 40 = 1046, then +3 = 1049. So uj = 1049.\n\ngq = uj - 92. 1049 - 92. Let's subtract 100 first: 1049 - 100 = 949, but since we subtracted 8 more than needed, add back 8: 949 + 8 = 957. Wait, actually, no. Wait, 1049 - 92: 1049 - 90 = 959, then -2 = 957. Yes, that's right. So gq = 957.\n\ntj = gq + 60. 957 + 60 = 1017. So tj = 1017.\n\nrm = tj + 49. 1017 + 49. Let's do 1017 + 40 = 1057, then +9 = 1066. So rm = 1066.\n\nlz = rm - 18. 1066 - 18. 1066 - 10 = 1056, then -8 = 1048. So lz = 1048.\n\ntr = lz - 56. 1048 - 56. Subtract 50: 1048 - 50 = 998, then -6 = 992. So tr = 992.\n\ndj = tr - 42. 992 - 42. Subtract 40: 992 - 40 = 952, then -2 = 950. So dj = 950.\n\nka = dj + 83. 950 + 83. 950 + 80 = 1030, +3 = 1033. So ka = 1033.\n\nyc = ka - 53. 1033 - 53. Subtract 50: 1033 - 50 = 983, then -3 = 980. So yc = 980.\n\ngf = yc + 57. 980 + 57. 980 + 50 = 1030, +7 = 1037. So gf = 1037.\n\nmw = gf + 17. 1037 + 17 = 1054. So mw = 1054.\n\nma = mw - 99. 1054 - 99. Let's subtract 100: 1054 - 100 = 954, then add back 1: 955. Wait, no. Wait, 1054 - 99: 1054 - 100 is 954, so since we subtracted 1 more, add 1 back: 954 +1 = 955. So ma = 955.\n\ncy = ma - 66. 955 - 66. Subtract 60: 955 - 60 = 895, then -6 = 889. So cy = 889.\n\nvj = cy - 21. 889 - 21 = 868. So vj = 868.\n\nzo = vj + 20. 868 + 20 = 888. So zo = 888.\n\nol = zo - 62. 888 - 62. Subtract 60: 888 - 60 = 828, then -2 = 826. So ol = 826.\n\nWait, let me check that again. zo is 888. Subtract 62: 888 - 60 is 828, then subtract 2 more: 826. Yes. So ol should be 826.\n\nBut let me go back through each step to make sure I didn't make any arithmetic errors. It's easy to miscalculate somewhere.\n\nStarting from pc = 776.\n\nwy = 776 +37 = 813 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nhe = 813 -53 = 760 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nip = 760 +49 = 809 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngp = 809 +41 = 850 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nhq = 850 +72 = 922 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngr = 922 -44 = 878 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ndp = 878 -35 = 843 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nfy = 843 +83 = 926 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nle = 926 -29 = 897 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nan = 897 +51 = 948 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nrj = 948 -35 = 913 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nsk = 913 +70 = 983 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nza = 983 -75 = 908 \u2714\ufe0f\n\neo = 908 +78 = 986 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nbc = 986 +20 = 1006 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nuj = 1006 +43 = 1049 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngq = 1049 -92 = 957 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ntj = 957 +60 = 1017 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nrm = 1017 +49 = 1066 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nlz = 1066 -18 = 1048 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ntr = 1048 -56 = 992 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ndj = 992 -42 = 950 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nka = 950 +83 = 1033 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nyc = 1033 -53 = 980 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngf = 980 +57 = 1037 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nmw = 1037 +17 = 1054 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nma = 1054 -99 = 955 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ncy = 955 -66 = 889 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nvj = 889 -21 = 868 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nzo = 868 +20 = 888 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nol = 888 -62 = 826 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nAll steps check out. So the final value of ol is 826.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of ol is \\boxed{826}.\n\n\n\nStarting with \\( pc = 776 \\), we calculate each subsequent variable step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nwy &= pc + 37 = 776 + 37 = 813, \\\\\nhe &= wy - 53 = 813 - 53 = 760, \\\\\nip &= he + 49 = 760 + 49 = 809, \\\\\ngp &= ip + 41 = 809 + 41 = 850, \\\\\nhq &= gp + 72 = 850 + 72 = 922, \\\\\ngr &= hq - 44 = 922 - 44 = 878, \\\\\ndp &= gr - 35 = 878 - 35 = 843, \\\\\nfy &= dp + 83 = 843 + 83 = 926, \\\\\nle &= fy - 29 = 926 - 29 = 897, \\\\\nan &= le + 51 = 897 + 51 = 948, \\\\\nrj &= an - 35 = 948 - 35 = 913, \\\\\nsk &= rj + 70 = 913 + 70 = 983, \\\\\nza &= sk - 75 = 983 - 75 = 908, \\\\\neo &= za + 78 = 908 + 78 = 986, \\\\\nbc &= eo + 20 = 986 + 20 = 1006, \\\\\nuj &= bc + 43 = 1006 + 43 = 1049, \\\\\ngq &= uj - 92 = 1049 - 92 = 957, \\\\\ntj &= gq + 60 = 957 + 60 = 1017, \\\\\nrm &= tj + 49 = 1017 + 49 = 1066, \\\\\nlz &= rm - 18 = 1066 - 18 = 1048, \\\\\ntr &= lz - 56 = 1048 - 56 = 992, \\\\\ndj &= tr - 42 = 992 - 42 = 950, \\\\\nka &= dj + 83 = 950 + 83 = 1033, \\\\\nyc &= ka - 53 = 1033 - 53 = 980, \\\\\ngf &= yc + 57 = 980 + 57 = 1037, \\\\\nmw &= gf + 17 = 1037 + 17 = 1054, \\\\\nma &= mw - 99 = 1054 - 99 = 955, \\\\\ncy &= ma - 66 = 955 - 66 = 889, \\\\\nvj &= cy - 21 = 889 - 21 = 868, \\\\\nzo &= vj + 20 = 868 + 20 = 888, \\\\\nol &= zo - 62 = 888 - 62 = 826.\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThe value of \\( ol \\) is \\(\\boxed{826}\\)."}
