7.\n\nWait, let me double-check some steps to make sure I didn't make any errors. For example, when calculating ta = xn - 54, where xn was 724. 724 - 54 is indeed 670. Then pi = ta - 87: 670 - 87. Let's do 670 - 80 = 590, then -7 = 583. Correct. Then oj = 583 - 14 = 569. Then jp = 569 + 29. 569 + 20 is 589, +9 is 598. Correct. xa = 598 + 76: 598 + 70 = 668, +6 = 674. Then bf = 674 + 89. 674 + 80 = 754, +9 = 763. lo = 763 -14 = 749. Then vk = 749 +88. 749 + 80 = 829, +8=837. That seems right.\n\nLet me check another part. Let's see, starting from bq = 705, then yo = 705 +19=724. Then tu=724+79=803. gt=803+16=819. za=819-37=782. qx=782-86=696. jo=696+79=775. qc=775-23=752. hy=752-15=737. bd=737-68=669. it=669+15=684. fr=684-22=662. fc=662+20=682. in=682+96=778. xn=778-54=724. ta=724-54=670. pi=670-87=583. oj=583-14=569. jp=569+29=598. xa=598+76=674. bf=674+89=763. lo=763-14=749. vk=749+88=837. Yes, that all checks out. I think 837 is the correct value for vk.\n\n\n\nThe value of **vk** is calculated by sequentially evaluating each variable starting from **hz** through **vk**. Here's the step-by-step breakdown:\n\n1. **hz** = 649  \n2. **zz** = 649 + 75 = 724  \n3. **ic** = 724 + 92 = 816  \n4. **ra** = 816 + 69 = 885  \n5. **xr** = 885 - 50 = 835  \n6. **vl** = 835 - 65 = 770  \n7. **cg** = 770 + 17 = 787  \n8. **fa** = 787 - 35 = 752  \n9. **su** = 752 - 64 = 688  \n10. **bq** = 688 + 17 = 705  \n11. **yo** = 705 + 19 = 724  \n12. **tu** = 724 + 79 = 803  \n13. **gt** = 803 + 16 = 819  \n14. **za** = 819 - 37 = 782  \n15. **qx** = 782 - 86 = 696  \n16. **jo** = 696 + 79 = 775  \n17. **qc** = 775 - 23 = 752  \n18. **hy** = 752 - 15 = 737  \n19. **bd** = 737 - 68 = 669  \n20. **it** = 669 + 15 = 684  \n21. **fr** = 684 - 22 = 662  \n22. **fc** = 662 + 20 = 682  \n23. **in** = 682 + 96 = 778  \n24. **xn** = 778 - 54 = 724  \n25. **ta** = 724 - 54 = 670  \n26. **pi** = 670 - 87 = 583  \n27. **oj** = 583 - 14 = 569  \n28. **jp** = 569 + 29 = 598  \n29. **xa** = 598 + 76 =