al Answer**\nThe value of uq is \\boxed{455}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given assignments, we compute each variable step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n\\text{vp} & = 301 \\\\\n\\text{cz} & = 301 - 48 = 253 \\\\\n\\text{nq} & = 253 - 75 = 178 \\\\\n\\text{xo} & = 178 + 62 = 240 \\\\\n\\text{xw} & = 240 - 76 = 164 \\\\\n\\text{lj} & = 164 + 49 = 213 \\\\\n\\text{dk} & = 213 - 85 = 128 \\\\\n\\text{uc} & = 128 - 60 = 68 \\\\\n\\text{no} & = 68 + 57 = 125 \\\\\n\\text{pm} & = 125 + 43 = 168 \\\\\n\\text{qj} & = 168 + 98 = 266 \\\\\n\\text{at} & = 266 - 18 = 248 \\\\\n\\text{bh} & = 248 - 30 = 218 \\\\\n\\text{ec} & = 218 - 90 = 128 \\\\\n\\text{rn} & = 128 - 69 = 59 \\\\\n\\text{zr} & = 59 - 89 = -30 \\\\\n\\text{iw} & = -30 + 51 = 21 \\\\\n\\text{nt} & = 21 + 95 = 116 \\\\\n\\text{dj} & = 116 - 11 = 105 \\\\\n\\text{tp} & = 105 + 61 = 166 \\\\\n\\text{mz} & = 166 - 80 = 86 \\\\\n\\text{xy} & = 86 + 65 = 151 \\\\\n\\text{vj} & = 151 + 47 = 198 \\\\\n\\text{qn} & = 198 + 16 = 214 \\\\\n\\text{hw} & = 214 + 92 = 306 \\\\\n\\text{rp} & = 306 - 25 = 281 \\\\\n\\text{gs} & = 281 + 90 = 371 \\\\\n\\text{iq} & = 371 + 14 = 385 \\\\\n\\text{rc} & = 385 + 29 = 414 \\\\\n\\text{qb} & = 414 + 67 = 481 \\\\\n\\text{we} & = 481 - 39 = 442 \\\\\n\\text{uq} & = 442 + 13 = 455 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThe value of \\(\\text{uq}\\) is \\(\\boxed{455}\\)."}
