4. 700 + 30 is 730, 68 + 4 is 72, so total 802. Wait, 768 + 34: 768 + 30 is 798, then +4 is 802. Yes, bk = 802.\n\nwx = bk + 17. 802 + 17 = 819. So wx = 819.\n\ngg = wx + 44. 819 + 44. 800 + 40 = 840, 19 + 4 = 23, so 840 + 23 = 863. So gg = 863.\n\nqz = gg + 97. 863 + 97. Let's do 863 + 100 = 963, minus 3 = 960. So qz = 960.\n\nzd = qz + 76. 960 + 76. 960 + 70 = 1030, +6 = 1036. So zd = 1036.\n\npm = zd + 44. 1036 + 44. 1000 + 44 = 1044, then +36 = 1080. Wait, 1036 + 40 = 1076, +4 = 1080. Yes, pm = 1080.\n\nub = pm + 36. 1080 + 36 = 1116. So ub = 1116.\n\noq = ub + 64. 1116 + 64. 1116 + 60 = 1176, +4 = 1180. So oq = 1180.\n\nvl = oq + 17. 1180 + 17 = 1197. So vl = 1197.\n\nrn = vl - 56. 1197 - 56. 1197 - 50 = 1147, -6 = 1141. So rn = 1141.\n\ntu = rn + 41. 1141 + 41. 1141 + 40 = 1181, +1 = 1182. So tu = 1182.\n\nko = tu + 20. 1182 + 20 = 1202. So ko = 1202.\n\nbc = ko + 18. 1202 + 18 = 1220. So bc = 1220.\n\noi = bc + 15. 1220 + 15 = 1235. So oi = 1235.\n\nsi = oi + 57. 1235 + 57. 1235 + 50 = 1285, +7 = 1292. So si = 1292.\n\nmo = si - 26. 1292 - 26. 1292 - 20 = 1272, -6 = 1266. So mo = 1266.\n\noz = mo + 33. 1266 + 33. 1260 + 30 = 1290, 6 + 3 = 9, so 1299. So oz = 1299.\n\nqr = oz + 59. 1299 + 59. 1299 + 50 = 1349, +9 = 1358. So qr = 1358.\n\nus = qr + 41. 1358 + 41. 1300 + 40 = 1340, 58 + 1 = 59, so 1358 + 41 = 1399. Wait, 1358 + 40 = 1398, +1 = 1399. So us = 1399.\n\ngm = us + 14. 1399 + 14 = 1413. So gm = 1413.\n\nwb = gm + 54. 1413 + 54. 1400 + 50 = 1450, 13 + 4 = 17, so 1450 + 17 = 1467. So wb = 1467.\n\ngz = wb + 46. 1467 + 46. 1460 + 40 = 1500, 7 + 6 = 13, so 1500 + 13 = 1513. So gz = 1513.\n\njh = gz - 72. 1513 - 72. 1513 - 70 = 1443, -2 = 1441. So jh = 1441.\n\njc = jh + 49. 1441 + 49. 1440 + 40 = 1480, 1 + 9 = 10, so 1480 + 10 = 1490. So jc = 1490.\n\nay = jc - 80. 1490 - 80 = 1410. So ay = 1410.\n\ngy = ay + 43. 1410 + 43 = 1453. So gy = 1453.\n\nmu = gy - 89. 1453 - 89. Let's subtract 90 first: 1453 - 90 = 1363, then add back 1: 1363 + 1 = 1364. So mu =