24. So rx = 1924.\n\nnv = rx + 29. 1924 + 29. 1920 + 20 = 1940, 4 + 9 = 13, so total 1940 + 13 = 1953. So nv = 1953.\n\nwj = nv + 59. 1953 + 59. 1950 + 50 = 2000, 3 + 9 = 12, so 2000 + 12 = 2012. Wait, that's not right. Wait, 1953 + 50 = 2003, +9 = 2012. So wj = 2012.\n\nvy = wj - 30. 2012 - 30 = 1982. So vy = 1982.\n\nWait, let me double-check these calculations step by step to make sure I didn't make a mistake anywhere. It's easy to have an arithmetic error here. Let me verify a few steps.\n\nStarting from the beginning:\n\ncf = 841\n\ndp = 841 -72 = 769 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ndi = 769 +51 = 820 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nof = 820 +88 = 908 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngr = 908 -71 = 837 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nmd = 837 -48 = 789 \u2714\ufe0f\n\njx = 789 -49 = 740 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nxw = 740 +72 = 812 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nij = 812 -97 = 715 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nxx = 715 +53 = 768 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nbk = 768 +34 = 802 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nwx = 802 +17 = 819 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngg = 819 +44 = 863 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nqz = 863 +97 = 960 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nzd = 960 +76 = 1036 \u2714\ufe0f\n\npm = 1036 +44 = 1080 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nub = 1080 +36 = 1116 \u2714\ufe0f\n\noq = 1116 +64 = 1180 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nvl = 1180 +17 = 1197 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nrn = 1197 -56 = 1141 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ntu = 1141 +41 = 1182 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nko = 1182 +20 = 1202 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nbc = 1202 +18 = 1220 \u2714\ufe0f\n\noi = 1220 +15 = 1235 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nsi = 1235 +57 = 1292 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nmo = 1292 -26 = 1266 \u2714\ufe0f\n\noz = 1266 +33 = 1299 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nqr = 1299 +59 = 1358 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nus = 1358 +41 = 1399 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngm = 1399 +14 = 1413 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nwb = 1413 +54 = 1467 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngz = 1467 +46 = 1513 \u2714\ufe0f\n\njh = 1513 -72 = 1441 \u2714\ufe0f\n\njc = 1441 +49 = 1490 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nay = 1490 -80 = 1410 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngy = 1410 +43 = 1453 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nmu = 1453 -89 = 1364 \u2714\ufe0f\n\ngv = 1364 +70 = 1434 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nfj = 1434 +21 = 1455 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nuc = 1455 -23 = 1432 \u2714\ufe0f\n\noe = 1432 +67 = 1499 \u2714\ufe0f\n\nug 