ach subsequent variable is built by adding or subtracting numbers. Since there are so many steps, I need to be careful not to make any arithmetic errors. Let me try to go through each step one by one and keep track of the values.\n\nStarting with jj = 798.\n\nThen xi = jj + 45. So 798 + 45. Let me compute that. 798 + 40 is 838, then +5 is 843. So xi = 843.\n\nNext, vl = xi + 99. That's 843 + 99. Hmm, 843 + 100 would be 943, minus 1 is 942. So vl = 942.\n\nThen fd = vl - 79. 942 - 79. Let's do 942 - 70 first, which is 872, then subtract 9 more: 872 - 9 = 863. So fd = 863.\n\noo = fd + 93. 863 + 93. 863 + 90 is 953, plus 3 is 956. So oo = 956.\n\nxu = oo + 91. 956 + 91. 956 + 90 is 1046, plus 1 is 1047. So xu = 1047.\n\nsr = xu - 46. 1047 - 46. 1047 - 40 is 1007, minus 6 is 1001. So sr = 1001.\n\nyq = sr + 18. 1001 + 18 = 1019. yq = 1019.\n\nww = yq - 91. 1019 - 91. Let's subtract 90 first: 1019 - 90 = 929, then subtract 1 more: 928. So ww = 928.\n\ncp = ww - 21. 928 - 21 = 907. cp = 907.\n\nxw = cp - 18. 907 - 18. 907 - 10 is 897, minus 8 is 889. xw = 889.\n\nan = xw - 29. 889 - 29. 889 - 20 = 869, minus 9 = 860. an = 860.\n\nsm = an + 47. 860 + 47. 860 + 40 = 900, plus 7 = 907. sm = 907.\n\nkf = sm - 63. 907 - 63. 907 - 60 = 847, minus 3 = 844. kf = 844.\n\nvs = kf + 15. 844 + 15 = 859. vs = 859.\n\njf = vs + 58. 859 + 58. 859 + 50 = 909, plus 8 = 917. jf = 917.\n\nho = jf - 80. 917 - 80 = 837. ho = 837.\n\nsn = ho - 74. 837 - 74. Let's subtract 70 first: 837 - 70 = 767, then subtract 4: 763. sn = 763.\n\nvh = sn + 14. 763 + 14 = 777. vh = 777.\n\nvq = vh - 10. 777 - 10 = 767. vq = 767.\n\nst = vq + 23. 767 + 23. 767 + 20 = 787, plus 3 = 790. st = 790.\n\npq = st + 35. 790 + 35 = 825. pq = 825.\n\nze = pq - 47. 825 - 47. 825 - 40 = 785, minus 7 = 778. ze = 778.\n\nfy = ze - 29. 778 - 29. 778 - 20 = 758, minus 9 = 749. fy = 749.\n\njd = fy + 53. 749 + 53. 749 + 50 = 799, plus 3 = 802. jd = 802.\n\nza = jd - 56. 802 - 56. 802 - 50 = 752, minus 6 = 746. za = 746.\n\nfz