 = 827.\n\nsf = bv + 53. 827 + 53. 827 + 50 = 877, plus 3 = 880. So sf = 880.\n\nWait, let me check if I did each step correctly. Let me verify a few steps in case I made an arithmetic error.\n\nStarting from jh =741:\n\njh=741\n\nly=741-76=665 (correct)\n\neb=665-99=566 (correct)\n\npp=566-28=538 (correct)\n\nsw=538+18=556 (correct)\n\ngc=556-35=521 (correct)\n\ndo=521-45=476 (correct)\n\ncq=476+55=531 (correct)\n\nau=531-85=446 (correct)\n\npv=446-91=355 (correct)\n\nvq=355+51=406 (correct)\n\nlk=406+17=423 (correct)\n\nci=423+45=468 (correct)\n\nit=468+25=493 (correct)\n\num=493-32=461 (correct)\n\nvd=461-68=393 (correct)\n\noe=393+15=408 (correct)\n\nkx=408-99=309 (correct)\n\ngu=309+46=355 (correct)\n\nee=355-12=343 (correct)\n\nki=343-46=297 (correct)\n\nil=297-29=268 (correct)\n\nba=268-89=179 (correct)\n\nzg=179+47=226 (correct)\n\nkg=226+66=292 (correct)\n\nks=292-27=265 (correct)\n\nhq=265-58=207 (correct)\n\ngm=207+52=259 (correct)\n\nmf=259+56=315 (correct)\n\nys=315+68=383 (correct)\n\nor=383+56=439 (correct)\n\ndk=439-47=392 (correct)\n\nxw=392+66=458 (correct)\n\nnh=458+64=522 (correct)\n\nph=522+24=546 (correct)\n\nty=546+17=563 (correct)\n\nju=563+31=594 (correct)\n\nha=594+87=681 (correct)\n\njt=681+79=760 (correct)\n\nsq=760-84=676 (correct)\n\nla=676+51=727 (correct)\n\ndn=727+25=752 (correct)\n\nvo=752-62=690 (correct)\n\nlv=690+71=761 (correct)\n\nah=761+40=801 (correct)\n\nlm=801-62=739 (correct)\n\nwo=739-14=725 (correct)\n\nmh=725+63=788 (correct)\n\nua=788-41=747 (correct)\n\nhr=747-37=710 (correct)\n\nqh=710-34=676 (correct)\n\nqr=676+14=690 (correct)\n\nxp=690-42=648 (correct)\n\nlj=648+77=725 (correct)\n\nqz=725+39=764 (correct)\n\nru=764-43=721 (correct)\n\ngj=721+51=772 (correct)\n\nje=772+50=822 (correct)\n\nma=822+82=904 (correct)\n\nkf=904-93=811 (correct)\n\nbs=811+73=884 (correct)\n\ndf=884-21=863 (correct)\n\nbv=863-36=827 (correct)\n\nsf=827+53=880 (correct)\n\nLooks like each step checks out. So the final value of sf should be 880.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of sf is \\boxed{880}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given assignments, we calculate each variable step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\njh &= 741 \\\\\nly &= jh - 76 = 741 - 76 = 665 \\\\\neb &= ly - 99 = 665 - 99 = 566 \\\\\npp &= eb - 28 = 566 - 28 = 538 \\\\\nsw &= pp + 18 = 538 + 18 = 556 \\\\\ngc &= sw - 35 = 556 - 35 = 521 \\\\\ndo &= gc - 45 = 521 - 45 = 476 \\\\\ncq &= do + 55 = 476 + 55 = 531 \\\\\nau &= cq - 85 = 531 - 85 = 446 \\\\\npv &= au - 91 = 446 - 91 = 355 \\\\\nvq &= pv + 51 = 355 + 51 = 406 \\\\\nlk &= vq + 17 = 406 + 17 = 423 \\\\\nci &= lk + 45 = 423 + 45 = 468 \\\\\nit &= ci + 25 = 468 + 25 = 493 \\\\\num &= it - 32 = 493 - 32 = 461 \\\\\nvd &= um - 68 = 461 - 68 = 393 \\\\\noe &= vd + 15 = 393 + 15 = 408 \\\\\nkx &= oe - 99 = 408 - 99 = 309 \\\\\ngu &= kx + 46 = 309 + 46 = 355 \\\\\nee &= gu - 12 = 355 - 12 = 343 \\\\\nki &= ee - 46 = 343 - 46 = 297 \\\\\nil &= ki - 29 = 297 - 29 = 268 \\\\\nba &= il - 89 = 268 - 89 = 179 \\\\\nzg &= ba + 47 = 179 + 47 = 226 \\\\\nkg &= zg + 66 = 226 + 66 = 292 \\\\\nks &= kg - 27 = 292 - 27 = 265 \\\\\nhq &= ks - 58 = 265 - 58 = 207 \\\\\ngm &= hq + 52 = 207 + 52 = 259 \\\\\nmf &= gm + 56 = 259 + 56 = 315 \\\\\nys &= mf + 68 = 315 + 68 = 383 \\\\\nor &= ys + 56 = 383 + 56 = 439 \\\\\ndk &= or - 47 = 439 - 47 = 392 \\\\\nxw &= dk + 66 = 392 + 66 = 458 \\\\\nnh &= xw + 64 = 458 + 64 = 522 \\\\\nph &= nh + 24 = 522 + 24 = 546 \\\\\nty &= ph + 17 = 546 + 17 = 563 \\\\\nju &= ty + 31 = 563 + 31 = 594 \\\\\nha &= ju + 87 = 594 + 87 = 681 \\\\\njt &= ha + 79 = 681 + 79 = 760 \\\\\nsq &= jt - 84 = 760 - 84 = 676 \\\\\nla &= sq + 51 = 676 + 51 = 727 \\\\\ndn &= la + 25 = 727 + 25 = 752 \\\\\nvo &= dn - 62 = 752 - 62 = 690 \\\\\nlv &= vo + 71 = 690 + 71 = 761 \\\\\nah &= lv + 40 = 761 + 40 = 801 \\\\\nlm &= ah - 62 = 801 - 62 = 739 \\\\\nwo &= lm - 14 = 739 - 14 = 725 \\\\\nmh &= wo + 63 = 725 + 63 = 788 \\\\\nua &= mh - 41 = 788 - 41 = 747 \\\\\nhr &= ua - 37 = 747 - 37 = 710 \\\\\nqh