n\nuw = zr - 12. 506 - 12 is 494. So uw is 494.\n\nbd = uw - 61. 494 - 61. Let's subtract 60 first: 494 - 60 = 434, then minus 1 more is 433. So bd is 433.\n\nsi = bd + 80. 433 + 80. 433 + 80 is 513. So si is 513.\n\njv = si - 56. 513 - 56. Hmm, 513 - 50 is 463, then minus 6 more is 457. So jv is 457.\n\nzo = jv - 84. 457 - 84. Let's subtract 80 first: 457 - 80 = 377, then minus 4 more is 373. So zo is 373.\n\ncb = zo + 67. 373 + 67. 373 + 60 is 433, plus 7 is 440. So cb is 440.\n\nge = cb + 33. 440 + 33 is 473. So ge is 473.\n\nel = ge + 25. 473 + 25. 473 + 20 is 493, plus 5 is 498. So el is 498.\n\noq = el + 69. 498 + 69. Let's do 498 + 70 = 568, then subtract 1 to get 567. So oq is 567.\n\nsm = oq - 75. 567 - 75. 567 - 70 = 497, then minus 5 more is 492. So sm is 492.\n\njs = sm - 77. 492 - 77. 492 - 70 = 422, then minus 7 more is 415. Wait, no: 492 - 77. Let's subtract 70 from 492: 422, then subtract 7 more: 415. So js is 415.\n\noz = js - 69. 415 - 69. 415 - 60 = 355, minus 9 more is 346. So oz is 346.\n\nvk = oz + 85. 346 + 85. 346 + 80 = 426, plus 5 is 431. So vk is 431.\n\nea = vk - 47. 431 - 47. 431 - 40 = 391, minus 7 more is 384. So ea is 384.\n\nwp = ea + 65. 384 + 65. 384 + 60 = 444, plus 5 is 449. So wp is 449.\n\nan = wp + 36. 449 + 36. 449 + 30 = 479, plus 6 is 485. So an is 485.\n\nWait, the next one is \"in = an - 75\". But \"in\" might be a keyword in some programming languages, but here it's just a variable name. So 485 - 75 = 410. So in is 410.\n\nqb = in - 28. 410 - 28. 410 - 20 = 390, minus 8 more is 382. So qb is 382.\n\nla = qb - 45. 382 - 45. 382 - 40 = 342, minus 5 more is 337. So la is 337.\n\nhe = la + 49. 337 + 49. 337 + 40 = 377, plus 9 is 386. So he is 386.\n\npi = he - 49. 386 - 49. 386 - 40 = 346, minus 9 more is 337. So pi is 337.\n\ngh = pi + 20. 337 + 20 = 357. So gh is 357.\n\ncv = gh + 98. 357 + 98. 357 + 100 = 457, minus 2 is 455. So cv is 455.\n\nfm = cv - 71. 455 - 71. 455 - 70 = 385, minus 1 more is 384. So fm is 384.\n\nyi = fm + 16. 384 + 16 = 400. So yi is 400.\n\nrn = yi + 86. 400 + 86. 400 + 80 = 480, plus 6 is 486. So rn is 486.\n\nez = rn - 14. 486 - 14 = 472. So ez is 472.\n\nff = ez + 86. 472 + 86. 472 + 80 = 552, plus 6 is 558. So ff is 558.\n\nab = ff - 42. 558 - 42. 558 - 40 = 518, minus 2 more is 516. So ab is 516.\n\naf = ab - 93. 516 - 93. 516 - 90 = 426, minus 3 more is 423. So af is 423.\n\nig = af - 28. 423 - 28. 423 - 20 = 403, minus 8 more is 395. So ig is 395.\n\nim = ig + 91. 395 + 91. 395 + 90 = 485, plus 1 is 486. So im is 486.\n\ngn = im + 73. 486 + 73. 486 + 70 = 556, plus 3 is 559. So gn is 559.\n\ngo = gn - 36. 559 - 36. 559 - 30 = 529, minus 6 more is 523. So go is 523.\n\nlk = go + 82. 523 + 82. 523 + 80 = 603, plus 2 is 605. So lk is 605.\n\nmj = lk + 90. 605 + 90 = 695. So mj is 695.\n\nhv = mj - 23. 695 - 23 = 672. So hv is 672.\n\nvg = hv + 65. 672 + 65. 672 + 60 = 732, plus 5 is 737. So vg is 737.\n\nyq = vg - 29. 737 - 29. 737 - 30 = 707, plus 1 is 708. Wait, no: 737 - 29 is 708? Let me check. 737 minus 20 is 717, then minus 9 more is 708. Yes, so yq is 708.\n\nib = yq + 63. 708 + 63. 700 + 60 = 760, 8 + 3 = 11, so total 771. So ib is 771.\n\nht = ib - 28. 771 - 28. 771 - 20 = 751, minus 8 more is 743. So ht is 743.\n\npc = ht - 89. 743 - 89. 743 - 80 = 663, minus 9 more is 654. So pc is 654.\n\nlt = pc + 76. 654 + 76. 654 + 70 = 724, plus 6 is 730. So lt is 730.\n\naw = lt - 72. 730 - 72. 730 - 70 = 660, minus 2 more is 658. So aw is 658.\n\nof = aw - 71. 658 - 71. 658 - 70 = 588, minus 1 more is 587. So of is 587.\n\nqi = of - 47. 587 - 47. 587 - 40 = 547, minus 7 more is 540. So qi is 540.\n\nft = qi - 61. 540 - 61. 540 - 60 = 480, minus 1 more is 479. So ft is 479.\n\nkk = ft + 24. 479 + 24 = 503. So kk is 503.\n\nco = kk - 78. 503 - 78. 503 - 70 = 433, minus 8 more is 425. So co is 425.\n\nnb = co + 90. 425 + 90 = 515. So nb is 515.\n\nlw = nb - 53. 515 - 53. 515 - 50 = 465, minus 3 more is 462. So lw is 462.\n\nxt = lw + 21. 462 + 21 = 483. So xt is 483.\n\nxc = xt - 44. 483 - 44. 483 - 40 = 443, minus 4 more is 439. So xc is 439.\n\nad = xc - 18. 439 - 18 = 421. So ad is 421.\n\nxm = ad - 98. 421 - 98. 421 - 100 = 321, plus 2 is 323. So xm is 323.\n\nni = xm + 49. 323 + 49. 323 + 40 = 363, plus 9 is 372. So ni is 372.\n\ncp = ni - 81. 372 - 81. 372 - 80 = 292, minus 1 more is 291. So cp is 291.\n\nmf = cp - 72. 291 - 72. 291 - 70 = 221, minus 2 more is 219. So mf is 219.\n\nnz = mf - 98. 219 - 98. 219 - 100 = 119, plus 2 is 121. Wait, that's not right. Wait, 219 - 98. Let me subtract 98 from 219: 219 - 90 = 129, then minus 8 more is 121. Yes, so nz is 121.\n\nmb = nz - 53. 121 - 53. 121 - 50 = 71, minus 3 more is 68. So mb is 68.\n\nLet me double-check some of these steps to make sure I didn't make a mistake. Starting from the beginning:\n\nyn=592, kb=592-33=559. od=559-70=489. zr=489+17=506. uw=506-12=494. bd=494-61=433. si=433+80=513. jv=513-56=457. zo=457-84=373. cb=373+67=440. ge=440+33=473. el=473+25=498. oq=498+69=567. sm=567-75=492. js=492-77=415. oz=415-69=346. vk=346+85=431. ea=431-47=384. wp=384+65=449. an=449+36=485. in=485-75=410. qb=410-28=382. la=382-45=337. he=337+49=386. pi=386-49=337. Wait, pi=he-49, he was 386, so 386-49=337. Then gh=337+20=357. cv=357+98=455. fm=455-71=384. yi=384+16=400. rn=400+86=486. ez=486-14=472. ff=472+86=558. ab=558-42=516. af=516-93=423. ig=423-28=395. im=395+91=486. gn=486+73=559. go=559-36=523. lk=523+82=605. mj=605+90=695. hv=695-23=672. vg=672+65=737. yq=737-29=708. ib=708+63=771. ht=771-28=743. pc=743-89=654. lt=654+76=730. aw=730-72=658. of=658-71=587. qi=587-47=540. ft=540-61=479. kk=479+24=503. co=503-78=425. nb=425+90=515. lw=515-53=462. xt=462+21=483. xc=483-44=439. ad=439-18=421. xm=421-98=323. ni=323+49=372. cp=372-81=291. mf=291-72=219. nz=219-98=121. mb=121-53=68.\n\nOkay, that seems consistent. So the final value of mb is 68. I think that's correct.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of mb is \\boxed{68}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given assignments, we calculate each variable step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nyn &= 592 \\\\\nkb &= yn - 33 = 592 - 33 = 559 \\\\\nod &= kb - 70 = 559 - 70 = 489 \\\\\nzr &= od + 17 = 489 + 17 = 506 \\\\\nuw &= zr - 12 = 506 - 12 = 494 \\\\\nbd &= uw - 61 = 494 - 61 = 433 \\\\\nsi &= bd + 80 = 433 + 80 = 513 \\\\\njv &= si - 56 = 513 - 56 = 457 \\\\\nzo &= jv - 84 = 457 - 84 = 373 \\\\\ncb &= zo + 67 = 373 + 67 = 440 \\\\\nge &= cb + 33 = 440 + 33 = 473 \\\\\nel &= ge + 25 = 473 + 25 = 498 \\\\\noq &= el + 69 = 498 + 69 = 567 \\\\\nsm &= oq - 75 = 567 - 75 = 492 \\\\\njs &= sm - 77 = 492 - 77 = 415 \\\\\noz &= js - 69 = 415 - 69 = 346 \\\\\nvk &= oz + 85 = 346 + 85 = 431 \\\\\nea &= vk - 47 = 431 - 47 = 384 \\\\\nwp &= ea + 65 = 384 + 65 = 449 \\\\\nan &= wp + 36 = 449 + 36 = 485 \\\\\nin &= an - 75 = 485 - 75 = 410 \\\\\nqb &= in - 28 = 410 - 28 = 382 \\\\\nla &= qb - 45 = 382 - 45 = 337 \\\\\nhe &= la + 49 = 337 + 49 = 386 \\\\\npi &= he - 49 = 386 - 49 = 337 \\\\\ngh &= pi + 20 = 337 + 20 = 357 \\\\\ncv &= gh + 98 = 357 + 98 = 455 \\\\\nfm &= cv - 71 = 455 - 71 = 384 \\\\\nyi &= fm + 16 = 384 + 16 = 400 \\\\\nrn &= yi + 86 = 400 + 86 = 486 \\\\\nez &= rn - 14 = 486 - 14 = 472 \\\\\nff &= ez + 86 = 472 + 86 = 558 \\\\\nab &= ff - 42 = 558 - 42 = 516 \\\\\naf &= ab - 93 = 516 - 93 = 423 \\\\\nig &= af - 28 = 423 - 28 = 395 \\\\\nim &= ig + 91 = 395 + 91 = 486 \\\\\ngn &= im + 73 = 486 + 73 = 559 \\\\\ngo &= gn - 36 = 559 - 36 = 523 \\\\\nlk &= go + 82 = 523 + 82 = 605 \\\\\nmj &= lk + 90 = 605 + 90 = 695 \\\\\nhv &= mj - 23 = 695 - 23 = 672 \\\\\nvg &= hv + 65 = 672 + 65 = 737 \\\\\nyq &= vg - 29 = 737 - 29 = 708 \\\\\nib &= yq + 63 = 708 + 63 = 771 \\\\\nht &= ib - 28 = 771 - 28 = 743 \\\\\npc &= ht - 89 = 743 - 89 = 654 \\\\\nlt &= pc + 76 = 654 + 76 = 730 \\\\\naw &= lt - 72 = 730 - 72 = 658 \\\\\nof &= aw - 71 = 658 - 71 = 587 \\\\\nqi &= of - 47 = 587 - 47 = 540 \\\\\nft &= qi - 61 = 540 - 61 = 479 \\\\\nkk &= ft + 24 = 479 + 24 = 503 \\\\\nco &= kk - 78 = 503 - 78 = 425 \\\\\nnb &= co + 90 = 425 + 90 = 515 \\\\\nlw &= nb - 53 = 515 - 53 = 462 \\\\\nxt &= lw + 21 = 462 + 21 = 483 \\\\\nxc &= xt - 44 = 483 - 44 = 439 \\\\\nad &= xc - 18 = 439 - 18 = 421 \\\\\nxm &= ad - 98 = 421 - 98 = 323 \\\\\nni &= xm + 49 = 323 + 49 = 372 \\\\\ncp &= ni - 81 = 372 - 81 = 291 \\\\\nmf &= cp - 72 = 291 - 72 = 219 \\\\\nnz &= mf - 98 = 219 - 98 = 121 \\\\\nmb &= nz - 53 = 121 - 53 = 68 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThe value of \\( mb \\) is \\(\\boxed{68}\\)."}
