zx is -231.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of zx is \\boxed{-231}.\n\n\n\nTo determine the value of \\( zx \\), we follow the sequence of assignments step by step:\n\n1. \\( \\text{wn} = 173 \\)\n2. \\( \\text{bh} = \\text{wn} + 29 = 173 + 29 = 202 \\)\n3. \\( \\text{qx} = \\text{bh} - 82 = 202 - 82 = 120 \\)\n4. \\( \\text{ta} = \\text{qx} - 86 = 120 - 86 = 34 \\)\n5. \\( \\text{wt} = \\text{ta} + 24 = 34 + 24 = 58 \\)\n6. \\( \\text{ap} = \\text{wt} + 66 = 58 + 66 = 124 \\)\n7. \\( \\text{id} = \\text{ap} + 34 = 124 + 34 = 158 \\)\n8. \\( \\text{sf} = \\text{id} - 65 = 158 - 65 = 93 \\)\n9. \\( \\text{tj} = \\text{sf} - 67 = 93 - 67 = 26 \\)\n10. \\( \\text{ky} = \\text{tj} + 97 = 26 + 97 = 123 \\)\n11. \\( \\text{zt} = \\text{ky} - 28 = 123 - 28 = 95 \\)\n12. \\( \\text{gi} = \\text{zt} + 25 = 95 + 25 = 120 \\)\n13. \\( \\text{bj} = \\text{gi} - 68 = 120 - 68 = 52 \\)\n14. \\( \\text{un} = \\text{bj} - 31 = 52 - 31 = 21 \\)\n15. \\( \\text{th} = \\text{un} + 32 = 21 + 32 = 53 \\)\n16. \\( \\text{mx} = \\text{th} - 54 = 53 - 54 = -1 \\)\n17. \\( \\text{cz} = \\text{mx} - 65 = -1 - 65 = -66 \\)\n18. \\( \\text{jv} = \\text{cz} + 10 = -66 + 10 = -56 \\)\n19. \\( \\text{of} = \\text{jv} + 52 = -56 + 52 = -4 \\)\n20. \\( \\text{bt} = \\text{of} - 41 = -4 - 41 = -45 \\)\n21. \\( \\text{qo} = \\text{bt} + 43 = -45 + 43 = -2 \\)\n22. \\( \\text{fm} = \\text{qo} - 61 = -2 - 61 = -63 \\)\n23. \\( \\text{xt} = \\text{fm} + 59 = -63 + 59 = -4 \\)\n24. \\( \\text{nz} = \\text{xt} - 96 = -4 - 96 = -100 \\)\n25. \\( \\text{pa} = \\text{nz} + 77 = -100 + 77 = -23 \\)\n26. \\( \\text{qp} = \\text{pa} - 76 = -23 - 76 = -99 \\)\n27. \\( \\text{le} = \\text{qp} - 87 = -99 - 87 = -186 \\)\n28. \\( \\text{ki} = \\text{le} - 18 = -186 - 18 = -204 \\)\n29. \\( \\text{rz} = \\text{ki} + 72 = -204 + 72 = -132 \\)\n30. \\( \\text{gw} = \\text{rz} - 61 = -132 - 61 = -193 \\)\n31. \\( \\text{ly} = \\text{gw} + 63 = -193 + 63 = -130 \\)\n32. \\( \\text{oh} = \\text{ly} - 78 = -130 - 78 = -208