37 - 47 = -84  \n    fi = -84\n\n42. **vg = fi + 45**  \n    -84 + 45 = -39  \n    vg = -39\n\n43. **mi = vg - 75**  \n    -39 - 75 = -114  \n    mi = -114\n\n44. **ym = mi - 37**  \n    -114 - 37 = -151  \n    ym = -151\n\n45. **gl = ym - 76**  \n    -151 - 76 = -227  \n    gl = -227\n\n46. **ca = gl - 13**  \n    -227 - 13 = -240  \n    ca = -240\n\n47. **vw = ca + 98**  \n    -240 + 98 = -142  \n    vw = -142\n\n48. **gt = vw + 26**  \n    -142 + 26 = -116  \n    gt = -116\n\n49. **tz = gt - 63**  \n    -116 - 63 = -179  \n    tz = -179\n\n50. **dh = tz + 40**  \n    -179 + 40 = -139  \n    dh = -139\n\n51. **pu = dh + 65**  \n    -139 + 65 = -74  \n    pu = -74\n\n52. **xy = pu - 17**  \n    -74 - 17 = -91  \n    xy = -91\n\n53. **qm = xy - 15**  \n    -91 - 15 = -106  \n    qm = -106\n\n54. **xm = qm - 65**  \n    -106 - 65 = -171  \n    xm = -171\n\n55. **sm = xm + 61**  \n    -171 + 61 = -110  \n    sm = -110\n\n56. **su = sm + 84**  \n    -110 + 84 = -26  \n    su = -26\n\n57. **xz = su - 57**  \n    -26 - 57 = -83  \n    xz = -83\n\n58. **pd = xz - 82**  \n    -83 - 82 = -165  \n    pd = -165\n\n59. **vi = pd + 12**  \n    -165 + 12 = -153  \n    vi = -153\n\n60. **bf = vi + 13**  \n    -153 + 13 = -140  \n    bf = -140\n\n61. **zg = bf + 19**  \n    -140 + 19 = -121  \n    zg = -121\n\n62. **dg = zg - 78**  \n    -121 - 78 = -199  \n    dg = -199\n\n63. **ho = dg + 58**  \n    -199 + 58 = -141  \n    ho = -141\n\n64. **kh = ho + 55**  \n    -141 + 55 = -86  \n    kh = -86\n\nWait, that seems like a lot of steps and some negative numbers came into play. Let me verify a few steps where negatives started happening to make sure I didn't make a mistake.\n\nStarting from **qr = dp - 72** where dp was 108. 108 - 72 is indeed 36. Then **rm = qr - 43**, so 36 - 43 = -7. That seems right. Then **el = rm - 30** is -7 -30 = -37. Then fi = -37 -47 = -84. Then vg = -84 +45 = -39. Then mi = -39 -75 = -114. Then ym = -114 -37 = -151. Then gl = -151 -76 = -227. Then ca = -227 -13 = -240. Then vw = -240 +98 = -142. Then gt = -142 +26 = -116. Then tz = -116 -63 = -179. dh = -179 +40 = -139. pu = -139 +65 = -74. xy = -74 -17 = -91. qm = -91 -15 = -106. xm = -106 -65 = -171. sm = -171 +61 = -110. su = -110 +84 = -26. xz = -26 -57 = -83. pd = -83 -82 = -165. vi = -165 +12 = -153. bf = -153 +13 = -140. zg = -140 +19 = -121. dg = -121 -78 = -199. ho = -199 +58 = -141. kh = -141 +55 = -86.\n\nSo, according to these calculations, kh is -86. Let me check some steps again. For example, when we got to pd = -165, then vi = pd +12. So -165 +12 is indeed -153. Then bf = vi +13, which is -153 +13 = -140. Then zg = -140 +19 = -121. Then dg = -121 -78 = -199. Then ho = -199 +58 = -141. Then kh = -141 +55 = -86. That seems consistent.\n\nI think all the steps check out. The negative numbers might be a bit confusing, but each operation follows correctly. So, the final value of kh should be -86.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of kh is \\boxed{-86}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given assignments, we calculate each subsequent variable step by step:\n\n1. \\( \\text{sr} = 464 \\)\n2. \\( \\text{kp} = 464 - 98 = 366 \\)\n3. \\( \\text{zx} = 366 - 96 = 270 \\)\n4. \\( \\text{uv} = 270 - 24 = 246 \\)\n5. \\( \\text{nu} = 246 - 40 = 206 \\)\n6. \\( \\text{fq} = 206 - 56 = 150 \\)\n7. \\( \\text{pa} = 150 - 75 = 75 \\)\n8. \\( \\text{al} = 75 + 13 = 88 \\)\n9. \\( \\text{ot} = 88 - 65 = 23 \\)\n10. \\( \\text{ta} = 23 + 76 = 99 \\)\n11. \\( \\text{ku} = 99 + 38 = 137 \\)\n12. \\( \\text{zi} = 137 - 15 = 122 \\)\n13. \\( \\text{sd} = 122 - 36 = 86 \\)\n14. \\( \\text{xr} = 86 + 80 = 166 \\)\n15. \\( \\text{iz} = 166 + 32 = 198 \\)\n16. \\( \\text{vz} = 198 + 99 = 297 \\)\n17. \\( \\text{ab} = 297 - 14 = 283 \\)\n18. \\( \\text{yp} = 283 - 45 = 238 \\)\n19. \\( \\text{fs} = 238 - 54 = 184 \\)\n20. \\( \\text{ri} = 184 + 75 = 259 \\)\n21. \\( \\text{om} = 259 - 57 = 202 \\)\n22. \\( \\text{gk} = 202 + 53 = 255 \\)\n23. \\( \\text{nj} = 255 - 68 = 187 \\)\n24. \\( \\text{ih} = 187 - 99 = 88 \\)\n25. \\( \\text{ci} = 88 - 40 = 48 \\)\n26. \\( \\text{ws} = 48 + 69 = 117 \\)\n27. \\( \\text{hw} = 117 - 33 = 84 \\)\n28. \\( \\text{cy} = 84 + 38 = 122 \\)\n29. \\( \\text{uf} = 122 + 44 = 166 \\)\n30. \\( \\text{nh} = 166 - 32 = 134 \\)\n31. \\( \\text{py} = 134 + 11 = 145 \\)\n32. \\( \\text{dl} = 145 + 41 = 186 \\)\n33. \\( \\text{at} = 186 + 56 = 242 \\)\n34. \\( \\text{ck} = 242 + 13 = 255 \\)\n35. \\( \\text{ub} = 255 - 95 = 160 \\)\n36. \\( \\text{iu} = 160 - 91 = 69 \\)\n37. \\( \\text{dp} = 69 + 39 = 108 \\)\n38. \\( \\text{qr} = 108 - 72 = 36 \\)\n39. \\( \\text{rm} = 36 - 43 = -7 \\)\n40. \\( \\text{el} = -7 - 30 = -37 \\)\n41. \\( \\text{fi} = -37 - 47 = -84 \\)\n42. \\( \\text{vg} = -84 + 45 = -39 \\)\n43. \\( \\text{mi} = -39 - 75 = -114 \\)\n44. \\( \\text{ym} = -114 - 37 = -151 \\)\n45. \\( \\text{gl} = -151 - 76 = -227 \\)\n46. \\( \\text{ca} = -227 - 13 = -240 \\)\n47. \\( \\text{vw} = -240 + 98 = -142 \\)\n48. \\( \\text{gt} = -142 + 26 = -116 \\)\n49. \\( \\text{tz} = -116 - 63 = -179 \\)\n50. \\( \\text{dh} = -179 + 40 = -139 \\)\n51. \\( \\text{pu} = -139 + 65 = -74 \\)\n52. \\( \\text{xy} = -74 - 17 = -91 \\)\n53. \\( \\text{qm} = -91 - 15 = -106 \\)\n54. \\( \\text{xm} = -106 - 65 = -171 \\)\n55. \\( \\text{sm} = -171 + 61 = -110 \\)\n56. \\( \\text{su} = -110 + 84 = -26 \\)\n57. \\( \\text{xz} = -26 - 57 = -83 \\)\n58. \\( \\text{pd} = -83 - 82 = -165 \\)\n59. \\( \\text{vi} = -165 + 12 = -153 \\)\n60. \\( \\text{bf} = -153 + 13 = -140 \\)\n61. \\( \\text{zg} = -140 + 19 = -121 \\)\n62. \\( \\text{dg} = -121 - 78 = -199 \\)\n63. \\( \\text{ho} = -199 + 58 = -141 \\)\n64. \\( \\text{kh} = -141 + 55 = -86 \\)\n\nThe value of \\(\\text{kh}\\) is \\(\\boxed{-86}\\)."}
