rh = -306.\n\nwl = rh - 51. -306 - 51 = -357. wl = -357.\n\nmk = wl + 97. -357 + 97. Let's subtract: 357 - 97 = 260, so -260. Wait, no. Alternatively, -357 + 97 is the same as -(357 - 97) = -260. Wait, but 97 is less than 357. So, -357 + 97 = (-357 + 100) - 3 = -257 - 3 = -260. So mk = -260.\n\nzl = mk - 72. -260 - 72 = -332. zl = -332.\n\nrt = zl - 10. -332 - 10 = -342. rt = -342.\n\npy = rt - 99. -342 - 99. -342 - 100 = -442, plus 1 = -441. py = -441.\n\ncp = py + 53. -441 + 53. Let's compute: 441 - 53 = 388, so -388. Wait, no: -441 + 53 is like 53 - 441 = -388. So cp = -388.\n\nti = cp + 32. -388 + 32 = -356. ti = -356.\n\nat = ti + 83. -356 + 83. 356 - 83 = 273, so -273. at = -273.\n\nhs = at - 52. -273 - 52 = -325. hs = -325.\n\nfn = hs + 52. -325 + 52 = -273. fn = -273.\n\nva = fn + 50. -273 + 50 = -223. va = -223.\n\ngu = va - 68. -223 - 68 = -291. gu = -291.\n\nye = gu - 83. -291 - 83 = -374. ye = -374.\n\nlh = ye + 60. -374 + 60 = -314. lh = -314.\n\nuw = lh + 22. -314 + 22 = -292. uw = -292.\n\ntm = uw + 93. -292 + 93. Let's compute: 292 - 93 = 199, so -199. tm = -199.\n\nfz = tm - 30. -199 - 30 = -229. fz = -229.\n\ndy = fz + 84. -229 + 84. 229 - 84 = 145, so -145. dy = -145.\n\npo = dy - 57. -145 - 57 = -202. po = -202.\n\nbw = po - 39. -202 - 39 = -241. bw = -241.\n\ncx = bw + 77. -241 + 77. 241 - 77 = 164, so -164. cx = -164.\n\nsl = cx - 85. -164 - 85 = -249. sl = -249.\n\nvw = sl + 97. -249 + 97. 249 - 97 = 152, so -152. vw = -152.\n\nlq = vw - 68. -152 - 68 = -220. lq = -220.\n\npv = lq - 13. -220 - 13 = -233. pv = -233.\n\ntu = pv - 53. -233 - 53 = -286. tu = -286.\n\njd = tu + 44. -286 + 44. 286 - 44 = 242, so -242. jd = -242.\n\nWait, let me check that last calculation again. tu is -286, then jd = tu + 44. So -286 + 44. Let's do it step by step: subtract 44 from 286. 286 - 44 = 242. Since the original number is negative, it's -286 + 44 = -(286 - 44) = -242. So yes, jd = -242.\n\nHmm, that's the final answer. Let me just verify a few steps to make