alue of vc is \\boxed{676}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given value of \\( gm = 519 \\), we follow the sequence of assignments step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\nqm &= 519 - 56 = 463, \\\\\nza &= 463 - 74 = 389, \\\\\nlc &= 389 - 50 = 339, \\\\\nsw &= 339 - 59 = 280, \\\\\nin &= 280 - 13 = 267, \\\\\nss &= 267 + 30 = 297, \\\\\nue &= 297 - 10 = 287, \\\\\nhf &= 287 - 18 = 269, \\\\\ntx &= 269 + 83 = 352, \\\\\nuu &= 352 - 81 = 271, \\\\\njh &= 271 + 33 = 304, \\\\\nad &= 304 + 90 = 394, \\\\\nao &= 394 - 52 = 342, \\\\\nop &= 342 - 86 = 256, \\\\\nxb &= 256 - 41 = 215, \\\\\nqw &= 215 + 31 = 246, \\\\\ncs &= 246 + 32 = 278, \\\\\nfs &= 278 - 57 = 221, \\\\\njd &= 221 + 97 = 318, \\\\\nje &= 318 + 96 = 414, \\\\\nbr &= 414 + 62 = 476, \\\\\nrf &= 476 + 85 = 561, \\\\\nqa &= 561 + 54 = 615, \\\\\nyg &= 615 - 74 = 541, \\\\\nrk &= 541 - 95 = 446, \\\\\nbi &= 446 + 41 = 487, \\\\\nmy &= 487 + 81 = 568, \\\\\nvh &= 568 + 66 = 634, \\\\\ntp &= 634 - 71 = 563, \\\\\neo &= 563 + 46 = 609, \\\\\nzo &= 609 + 43 = 652, \\\\\non &= 652 - 14 = 638, \\\\\nax &= 638 - 41 = 597, \\\\\ngc &= 597 + 60 = 657, \\\\\ndm &= 657 + 53 = 710, \\\\\nex &= 710 + 29 = 739, \\\\\nau &= 739 - 16 = 723, \\\\\nrw &= 723 - 27 = 696, \\\\\ngi &= 696 - 13 = 683, \\\\\nvt &= 683 + 56 = 739, \\\\\nnn &= 739 + 57 = 796, \\\\\npu &= 796 - 72 = 724, \\\\\ntc &= 724 - 49 = 675, \\\\\nfy &= 675 + 78 = 753, \\\\\nhj &= 753 - 27 = 726, \\\\\nbm &= 726 + 58 = 784, \\\\\nsn &= 784 + 13 = 797, \\\\\njg &= 797 - 85 = 712, \\\\\ncy &= 712 - 92 = 620, \\\\\nhu &= 620 + 84 = 704, \\\\\nif &= 704 - 42 = 662, \\\\\nzx &= 662 - 27 = 635, \\\\\nww &= 635 + 28 = 663, \\\\\ncu &= 663 + 60 = 723, \\\\\nev &= 723 + 33 = 756, \\\\\nwb &= 756 + 92 = 848, \\\\\nst &= 848 - 28 = 820, \\\\\nwa &= 820 + 25 = 845, \\\\\nph &= 845 - 26 = 819, \\\\\nhx &= 819 - 78 = 741, \\\\\nnl &= 741 - 60 = 681, \\\\\nft &= 681 - 38 = 643, \\\\\nvc &= 643 + 33 = 676.\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n\nThus, the value of \\( vc \\) is \\(\\boxed{676}\\)."}
