 47. 880 + 47. 880 + 40 = 920, plus 7 = 927. ct is 927.\n\nuh = ct + 69. 927 + 69. 927 + 70 = 997, minus 1 = 996. uh is 996.\n\nfa = uh - 56. 996 - 56 = 940. fa is 940.\n\nbp = fa - 42. 940 - 42 = 898. bp is 898.\n\nvj = bp - 17. 898 - 17 = 881. vj is 881.\n\ngu = vj + 45. 881 + 45. 881 + 40 = 921, plus 5 = 926. gu is 926.\n\ndb = gu - 15. 926 - 15 = 911. db is 911.\n\nwx = db - 10. 911 - 10 = 901. wx is 901.\n\nis = wx - 18. 901 - 18 = 883. is is 883.\n\nwb = is + 53. 883 + 53. 883 + 50 = 933, plus 3 = 936. wb is 936.\n\nrp = wb - 17. 936 - 17 = 919. rp is 919.\n\nre = rp + 72. 919 + 72. 919 + 70 = 989, plus 2 = 991. re is 991.\n\ntl = re - 56. 991 - 56 = 935. tl is 935.\n\nyc = tl + 48. 935 + 48. 935 + 40 = 975, plus 8 = 983. yc is 983.\n\ntw = yc - 50. 983 - 50 = 933. tw is 933.\n\nzt = tw - 29. 933 - 29. 933 - 30 = 903, plus 1 = 904. zt is 904.\n\nta = zt - 63. 904 - 63. 904 - 60 = 844, minus 3 = 841. ta is 841.\n\nrk = ta + 40. 841 + 40 = 881. rk is 881.\n\ncg = rk + 93. 881 + 93. 881 + 90 = 971, plus 3 = 974. cg is 974.\n\ntm = cg + 26. 974 + 26 = 1000. tm is 1000.\n\nld = tm - 76. 1000 - 76 = 924. ld is 924.\n\ngr = ld + 26. 924 + 26 = 950. gr is 950.\n\nbw = gr + 95. 950 + 95. 950 + 90 = 1040, plus 5 = 1045. \n\nSo, after going through each step, the value of bw is 1045. Let me just double-check the last few steps to make sure I didn't make an arithmetic error.\n\nStarting from gr: ld was 924, adding 26 gives 950. Then bw is 950 + 95. 950 + 95: 950 + 100 is 1050, minus 5 is 1045. Yep, that's correct. So I think that's the right answer.\n\n\n\nThe value of **bw** is calculated by sequentially evaluating each variable based on the given assignments. Starting from **ow = 518**, each subsequent variable is derived by performing the specified arithmetic operations step-by-step. Following this chain through all variables leads to the final calculation:\n\n- **gr = 950** (derived from **ld = 924** + 26)\n- **bw = gr + 95** = 950 + 95 = **1045**\n\n**Answer:**  \n\\