s 25.\n\nqx = bh - 12. 25 - 12 = 13. So qx is 13.\n\ntf = qx + 19. 13 + 19 = 32. So tf is 32.\n\nos = tf + 62. 32 + 62 = 94. So os is 94.\n\ngh = os + 17. 94 + 17 = 111. So gh is 111.\n\now = gh - 71. 111 - 71 = 40. So ow is 40.\n\nkd = ow - 51. 40 - 51 = -11. So kd is -11.\n\npf = kd - 55. -11 - 55 = -66. So pf is -66.\n\ntw = pf + 14. -66 + 14 = -52. So tw is -52.\n\ngx = tw - 98. -52 - 98 = -150. So gx is -150.\n\njb = gx + 13. -150 + 13 = -137. So jb is -137.\n\ngu = jb - 75. -137 - 75 = -212. So gu is -212.\n\nme = gu + 25. -212 + 25 = -187. So me is -187.\n\nxd = me - 19. -187 - 19 = -206. So xd is -206.\n\nhm = xd + 87. -206 + 87. Let's calculate: 206 - 87 = 119, so it's -119. So hm is -119.\n\nvc = hm + 82. -119 + 82. 119 - 82 = 37, so it's -37. So vc is -37.\n\nFinally, qp = vc + 79. -37 + 79 = 42. \n\nWait, let me check that again. -37 + 79. That's the same as 79 - 37. 79 - 30 is 49, minus 7 is 42. Yes. So qp is 42.\n\nLet me just verify some steps to make sure I didn't make a mistake. Starting from the beginning, the first few steps:\n\nel=131, fd=166, vm=217, xn=121, ha=98, ix=69, ff=-7, zd=72, sh=-10, ql=-40, ih=-81, ik=-128, fr=-167, pl=-153, gk=-88, fe=-185, xw=-251, hk=-155, hy=-63, bc=-119, qa=-139, jl=-78, ct=3, dt=92, qo=117, mk=42, fc=23, gy=57, ty=133, um=200, kr=126, yd=66, je=5, rr=57, hw=134, an=51, lf=-26, yy=26, kg=118, dc=71, va=2, kz=23, ew=-18, wr=9, gp=-62, om=-50, cs=38, bh=25, qx=13, tf=32, os=94, gh=111, ow=40, kd=-11, pf=-66, tw=-52, gx=-150, jb=-137, gu=-212, me=-187, xd=-206, hm=-119, vc=-37, qp=42.\n\nSeems okay. All the steps check out. So the final answer is 42.\n\n\n\nThe value of **qp** is calculated by sequentially evaluating each variable assignment step-by-step. Starting from **el = 131**, each subsequent variable is derived by performing the specified arithmetic operations. After following all assignments through to the final variable **qp**, the result is:\n\n**qp = 42**\n\n**Step-by-Step Breakdown:**\n1. **el = 131**\n2