h but arrives at the same answer. So 910 is confirmed again. That gives me more confidence. So the answer is 910.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe value of \\( b \\) is \\boxed{910}.\n\n\n\nStarting with the given assignments:\n\n1. \\( m = 978 \\)\n2. \\( y = m - 14 = 978 - 14 = 964 \\)\n3. \\( a = y - 82 = 964 - 82 = 882 \\)\n4. \\( g = a - 22 = 882 - 22 = 860 \\)\n5. \\( j = g + 83 = 860 + 83 = 943 \\)\n6. \\( u = j + 75 = 943 + 75 = 1018 \\)\n7. \\( p = u - 33 = 1018 - 33 = 985 \\)\n8. \\( b = p - 75 = 985 - 75 = 910 \\)\n\nVerification by substituting each variable step by step:\n\n\\[\nb = p - 75 = (u - 33) - 75 = u - 108 = (j + 75) - 108 = j - 33 = (g + 83) - 33 = g + 50 = (a - 22) + 50 = a + 28 = (y - 82) + 28 = y - 54 = (m - 14) - 54 = m - 68 = 978 - 68 = 910\n\\]\n\nThus, the value of \\( b \\) is \\(\\boxed{910}\\)."}
